The purpose of the amendment is to enable the Trustee and the Members to comply with the new superannuation measures by adopting the governing rules as the governing rules of the Fund..

f) Notwithstanding anything contained in this Deed to the contrary, this Deed does not and shall not:

(i)alter the objects of the Fund;

(ii)reduce the benefits and entitlements payable to Members;

(ii)alter the rights and benefits of existing Members in a manner such that, on the.whole, equity between Members is not maintained; or.
